invariant: INV-36
file: chapulin_cfg.zig
catches: test/zig-build-check.sh
reason: clientCfg (chapulin_cfg.zig) drops the values' ticket when takes_tickets is
  false. A client that keeps no new tickets then cannot resume the ticket
  it offers, and runs a full handshake in its place. Both loops resume a
  ticket with takes_tickets false, and object.
--- old
    if (options.ticket) |ticket| cfg.ticket = ticket.saved();
--- new
    if (if (options.takes_tickets) options.ticket else null) |ticket| cfg.ticket = ticket.saved();
